Z||000002||HugGRRRFiero||09-05-2000||12:07 PM||||I had my Fiero in local show over the weekend.  I wasn't the only Fiero there....  the other Fiero was a Lambo Countach Kit.  <P>I heard comments like "Look (guy pointing with a puzzled look), the spare is in the front?" and another guy said "Ok, the engine is in the back and a driveshaft goes up and turns the front wheels, right?"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>It's amazing how little people know about our small cars and they probably see them all the time.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">  <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||7
